	<title>【新春走基层】春节我在岗 供电有保障</title>
	<link>http://media.people.com.cn/n1/2021/0217/c435253-32030175.html</link>
	<content>showPlayer({id:"/pvservice/xml/2021/2/17/0f84d01f-9cba-40a6-bc7d-9802a0a156ca.xml",width:720,height:540}); &nbsp;</content>
